{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Sweeper is a tactical roguelike that fuses classic Minesweeper-style tile clearing with auto-battler combat. Each dungeon is a dangerous puzzle - every step could trigger a battle with a hidden monster, or reward you with loot and progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282820/extras/477496ee9b3c5a90d8598fe4585b3c6c.poster.avif?t=1755063858\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282820/extras/477496ee9b3c5a90d8598fe4585b3c6c.webm?t=1755063858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282820/extras/477496ee9b3c5a90d8598fe4585b3c6c.mp4?t=1755063858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open tiles to uncover numbered clues and flag suspected monster positions. If you guess wrong - or choose to risk it - you\u2019ll enter an strategic battle where your hero\u2019s gear, stats, and items determine the outcome. Victory brings rewards, defeat ends your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282820/extras/b193fe3d37d27212ebe2a9ffd18140ed.poster.avif?t=1755063858\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282820/extras/b193fe3d37d27212ebe2a9ffd18140ed.webm?t=1755063858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282820/extras/b193fe3d37d27212ebe2a9ffd18140ed.mp4?t=1755063858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough offers randomized dungeons, increasing difficulty, and new loot combinations to discover. The deeper you go, the more intense the encounters become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a fan of minesweeper puzzles or tactical roguelikes, Dungeon Sweeper offers a fresh challenge that rewards observation, risk-taking, and smart decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde8 Minesweeper-inspired exploration with hidden enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Fast-paced auto-battler combat when monsters are triggered</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Loot and equip gear to build your hero across the run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Procedurally generated dungeons with escalating difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2620\ufe0f Permadeath and replayability at the core</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you master the tiles and survive the depths of the dungeon?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3282820?t=1755063858","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3282820?t=1755063858","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282820/b1b0da6b3b1ec59c749a92f8450f1b2b064210c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755063858","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282820/b1b0da6b3b1ec59c749a92f8450f1b2b064210c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755063858","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3756950,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord to connect with the community, get the latest updates, and share your thoughts! Just head to the links section on the right and click the Discord button to join the conversation!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Sweeper is a tactical roguelike that fuses classic Minesweeper-style tile clearing with auto-battler combat. Each dungeon is a dangerous puzzle - every step could trigger a battle with a hidden monster, or reward you with loot and progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282820/extras/477496ee9b3c5a90d8598fe4585b3c6c.poster.avif?t=1755063858\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282820/extras/477496ee9b3c5a90d8598fe4585b3c6c.webm?t=1755063858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282820/extras/477496ee9b3c5a90d8598fe4585b3c6c.mp4?t=1755063858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open tiles to uncover numbered clues and flag suspected monster positions. If you guess wrong - or choose to risk it - you\u2019ll enter an strategic battle where your hero\u2019s gear, stats, and items determine the outcome. Victory brings rewards, defeat ends your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282820/extras/b193fe3d37d27212ebe2a9ffd18140ed.poster.avif?t=1755063858\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282820/extras/b193fe3d37d27212ebe2a9ffd18140ed.webm?t=1755063858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282820/extras/b193fe3d37d27212ebe2a9ffd18140ed.mp4?t=1755063858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough offers randomized dungeons, increasing difficulty, and new loot combinations to discover. The deeper you go, the more intense the encounters become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a fan of minesweeper puzzles or tactical roguelikes, Dungeon Sweeper offers a fresh challenge that rewards observation, risk-taking, and smart decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde8 Minesweeper-inspired exploration with hidden enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Fast-paced auto-battler combat when monsters are triggered</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Loot and equip gear to build your hero across the run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Procedurally generated dungeons with escalating difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2620\ufe0f Permadeath and replayability at the core</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you master the tiles and survive the depths of the dungeon?</p>","developers":["lpares12"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282820/8131433873d826d4bf8be43b81090394678279a5/header.jpg?t=1755063858","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel I3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel I5<b